<title>GERMANY: Preussag to raise flat steel prices.</title>
<headline>Preussag to raise flat steel prices.</headline>
<dateline>HANNOVER, Germany 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preussag Stahl AG said on Tuesday it planned to raise flat steel prices by 50 to 80 marks a tonne, effective July 1 for short-term quarterly contracts.</p>
<p>The company said good demand, an improved economic outlook, limited supply and higher-priced imports will help support the price move.</p>
</text>
